# These files are hashed, not read as text. Their SHA-256 is pinned in
# scripts/fetch_cbo_income_detail.py and published in PROVENANCE.csv, and the
# pin is the digest of the bytes raw.githubusercontent.com serves.
#
# `-text` disables git's end-of-line conversion for them in both directions, so
# a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` cannot rewrite LF to CRLF and
# break every digest (see fiscal_model/data_files/cbo_baseline/sources/).
* -text
